    "Question #: 3": {
      "Title": "Exam GMAT Section 2 Quantitative topic 2 question 241 discussion - ExamTopics",
      "Question": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "What is the value of (A + 3B/7)?"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "(1) 5600A + 2400B = 12,000."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "(2) 50B - 50 + 250A = 9700 4200A 1900B."
          }
        ]
      },
      "Choices": {
        "A": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "A. Statement (1) BY ITSELF is sufficient to answer the question, but statement (2) by itself is not."
            }
          ]
        },
        "B": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "B. Statement (2) BY ITSELF is sufficient to answer the question, but statement (1) by itself is not."
            }
          ]
        },
        "C": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "C. Statements (1) and (2) TAKEN TOGETHER are sufficient to answer the question, even though NEITHER statement BY ITSELF is sufficient."
            }
          ]
        },
        "D": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "D. Either statement BY ITSELF is sufficient to answer the question."
            }
          ]
        },
        "E": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "E. Statements (1) and (2) TAKEN TOGETHER are NOT sufficient to answer the question, requiring more data pertaining to the problem."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "Answer": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Suggested Answer: D \ud83d\uddf3\ufe0f"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Simplify the (1) statement by dividing both sides by 5600: A + 3B/7 = 15/7. This statement is sufficient."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Simplify the (2) statement by adding similar items to get: 4550A + 1950B = 9750. Divide both sides by 4550 to get: A + 3B/7 = 15/7 this statement is also sufficient."
          }
        ]
      },
      "Explanation": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Simplify the (1) statement by dividing both sides by 5600: A + 3B/7 = 15/7. This statement is sufficient."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Simplify the (2) statement by adding similar items to get: 4550A + 1950B = 9750. Divide both sides by 4550 to get: A + 3B/7 = 15/7 this statement is also sufficient."
          }
        ]
      },
